  `The Service Provider will deliver: {{deliverables}}. The project is described as follows: {{overview}}. Scope changes require written approval from both parties.`,
  `Services Included: {{overview}}. Specific deliverables: {{deliverables}}. Anything not listed here is outside the scope of this contract.`,
  `The Client is engaging the Service Provider to complete: {{overview}}. Final deliverables: {{deliverables}}. No additional work will be performed without a written change order.`,
  `Work Description: {{overview}}. Upon completion, the Client will receive: {{deliverables}}. Revisions beyond what is stated are billable at the Service Provider's standard rate.`,
