  `The Service Provider's responsibilities are limited to: {{overview}}. What the Client will receive: {{deliverables}}. Verbal requests do not modify this scope.`,
  `Project Definition: {{overview}}. Agreed deliverables: {{deliverables}}. Changes to scope must be submitted in writing and may affect timeline and price.`,
];

const contractPayment = [
