  `Compensation: \${{paymentAmount}} total, payable as follows: {{paymentTerms}}. Failure to pay within the agreed terms entitles the Service Provider to pause all work.`,
  `The Client will pay \${{paymentAmount}} according to these terms: {{paymentTerms}}. Overdue balances are subject to a late fee of 1.5% per month on the outstanding amount.`,
