  `Invoice Amount: \${{paymentAmount}}. Terms: {{paymentTerms}}. All fees are non-refundable once work has commenced unless otherwise agreed in writing.`,
  `Service Fee: \${{paymentAmount}}. The Client agrees to the following payment structure: {{paymentTerms}}. Accounts overdue by 30+ days may be referred to collections.`,
  `The Client will remit \${{paymentAmount}} as follows: {{paymentTerms}}. Any disputed invoice must be raised in writing within 7 days of receipt.`,
  `Agreed Compensation: \${{paymentAmount}}, structured as: {{paymentTerms}}. Payments not received within the agreed period allow the Service Provider to suspend work without liability.`,
];

const contractRevisions = [
  `Revisions: This contract includes {{revisions}} round(s) of revisions. Additional revisions beyond this are billed at the Service Provider's hourly rate.`,
  `The Client is entitled to {{revisions}} round(s) of changes at no additional cost. Further revisions will be scoped and quoted separately.`,
  `Included Revisions: {{revisions}}. Each revision round consists of a single consolidated set of feedback, not multiple separate requests.`,
  `Up to {{revisions}} revision round(s) are included in the project fee. Each round must be submitted in a single written document.`,
  `Revision Policy: {{revisions}} round(s) of revisions are included. Requests that change the original scope are treated as new work, not revisions.`,
  `The project fee covers {{revisions}} consolidated revision round(s). Revisions requested after final delivery are billed separately.`,
  `Client may request up to {{revisions}} round(s) of changes within the agreed project timeline. Post-delivery edits are outside this agreement.`,
  `Included in this contract: {{revisions}} round(s) of revisions. Each round must be submitted in full before the next is begun.`,
  `Revisions Included: {{revisions}} round(s). The Service Provider is not obligated to implement feedback that contradicts the original brief.`,
  `This agreement includes {{revisions}} revision round(s) at no additional charge. Rounds must be taken sequentially, not simultaneously.`,
];

