  `Ownership: Full intellectual property rights pass to the Client only after complete payment is received. Until then, all work remains the property of the Service Provider.`,
  `Upon final payment, the Client receives full ownership of all deliverables. The Service Provider may reference this project publicly as past work.`,
  `IP Transfer: Rights to the completed work transfer to the Client upon payment in full. Partial payment does not transfer any ownership rights.`,
  `The Client owns the final deliverables once the full invoice is settled. Work-in-progress files remain the Service Provider's property throughout the project.`,
