const contractConfidentiality = [
  `Confidentiality: The Service Provider agrees to keep all client business information, strategies, and data private both during and after the project. No client information will be shared without written permission.`,
  `Neither party will disclose proprietary information obtained during this engagement to any third party without prior consent.`,
  `All non-public information shared between the parties shall be treated as confidential and may not be disclosed to others.`,
  `The Service Provider agrees to maintain the confidentiality of the Client's business information, processes, and materials shared during the project.`,
  `Confidential Information includes all business, financial, and technical information disclosed during this engagement. Both parties agree to protect such information.`,
  `The receiving party agrees to hold all confidential information in strict confidence and to use it solely for fulfilling this agreement.`,
  `Confidentiality obligations extend beyond the term of this agreement. All confidential materials must be returned upon request or upon termination.`,
  `Both parties agree not to disclose any proprietary information, trade secrets, or business strategies learned during this engagement.`,
  `The Service Provider will not use or disclose the Client's confidential information for any purpose outside the scope of this contract.`,
  `Confidentiality: All information marked as confidential or reasonably understood to be confidential will be protected by both parties for the duration of this agreement and 3 years after.`,
