const contractTermination = [
  `Termination: Either party may end this agreement with 7 days written notice. Work completed to that point will be invoiced and is payable within 14 days.`,
  `Either party may terminate this contract with written notice. The Client owes payment for all work completed up to the termination date.`,
  `This agreement may be cancelled by either party at any time. A kill fee of 25% of the remaining balance applies if the Client terminates without cause.`,
  `Cancellation: If the Client cancels after work has begun, the Service Provider is owed compensation for all hours worked. A minimum kill fee of 25% applies.`,
  `Either party may exit this contract with 7 days notice. The Service Provider will invoice for completed work; the Client agrees to pay within 14 days.`,
  `Should either party wish to end this agreement early, written notice is required. All completed work must be paid for at the agreed rate.`,
  `Termination by the Client after project kickoff incurs a kill fee equal to 25% of the total contract value, plus payment for all work delivered.`,
  `This contract can be terminated by either party with written notice. Payment is due for all work completed prior to the termination date.`,
  `Early Termination: The Client may cancel with written notice but owes the full amount for work delivered plus a 25% kill fee on undelivered work.`,
  `Either party may terminate with 7 days written notice. The Service Provider reserves the right to retain the deposit as a kill fee if the project is cancelled after kickoff.`,
